                                                                                
 Usage: opentide generate explorer [OPTIONS]                                    
                                                                                
 Write explorer.bundle.json and explorer.search.json under .opentide/exports/.  
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --include-visibility               Also write explorer.visibility.json: the  │
│                                    log sources visibility.toml declares and  │
│                                    the rules that use them. Off by default:  │
│                                    it shows what you cannot see. A run       │
│                                    without it removes the file               │
│ --visibility-tlp            <str>  The TLP the explorer shows on the         │
│                                    Visibility view: clear, green, amber,     │
│                                    amber+strict or red                       │
│                                    [default: amber]                          │
│ --help                             Show this message and exit.               │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

 Examples
   $ opentide generate explorer
